---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About SidJam Studio, a small independent studio that writes original stories for kids.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <span class="kicker">About the studio</span>
    <h1>Small studio, big imaginations.</h1>
  </section>

  <div class="about prose">
    <p>
      SidJam Studio is a small independent studio. Right now we write stories for kids. Our
      characters get things wrong in very loud, very funny ways, and they come out a little
      wiser at the end.
    </p>
    <p>
      There's a boy who learns to protest like Gandhi, and a raccoon who blames his pancake
      crime on unionized ants. There are kids who run their family's budget into a blackout,
      and a neighborhood that turns a Wi-Fi outage into a chalk-drawn computer science game.
      Each story is written to be read aloud, laughed at, and talked about afterward.
    </p>
    <h2>What we care about</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Laughter first.</strong> If a kid isn't giggling by page two, we rewrite page two.</li>
      <li><strong>Ideas that stick.</strong> Each story carries one real idea about courage, honesty, listening, money, or how computers think.</li>
      <li><strong>Room to grow.</strong> Stories come first. Other ventures from the studio will follow.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Say hello</h2>
    <p>
      For questions, school readings, collaborations, or just to tell us your favorite
      character, write to <a href="mailto:hello@sidjamstudio.com">hello@sidjamstudio.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
